msgid "白天模式"
msgstr "Light Mode"

msgid "夜晚模式"
msgstr "Dark Mode"

msgid "跟随系统"
msgstr "Follow System"

msgid "仪表盘"
msgstr "Dashboard"

msgid "该模块的详细管理功能正在建设中，目前您可以看到此占位页面。"
msgstr "Detailed management features for this module are under development. This is currently a placeholder page."

msgid "新增"
msgstr "Add"

msgid "租户管理"
msgstr "Tenant Management"

msgid "用户管理"
msgstr "User Management"

msgid "这里将用于维护租户成员、账号状态和所属角色，后续会补充完整的增删改查能力。"
msgstr "This page will manage tenant members, account status, and assigned roles. Full CRUD capabilities will be added later."

msgid "新增用户"
msgstr "Add User"

msgid "角色管理"
msgstr "Role Management"

msgid "这里将用于维护 SaaS 后台角色、权限分配和访问范围，当前先提供独立页面入口。"
msgstr "This page will manage backend roles, permission assignments, and access scopes. For now, it provides an independent entry page."

msgid "新增角色"
msgstr "Add Role"

msgid "权限管理"
msgstr "Permission Management"

msgid "这里将用于维护菜单权限、操作权限和角色授权规则，详细内容后续再完善。"
msgstr "This page will manage menu permissions, action permissions, and role authorization rules. More details will be added later."

msgid "新增权限"
msgstr "Add Permission"

msgid "套餐管理"
msgstr "Plan Management"

msgid "这里将用于维护套餐、功能包和价格策略，当前先提供 SaaS 内部占位页面。"
msgstr "This page will manage plans, feature bundles, and pricing strategies. For now, it serves as an internal SaaS placeholder page."

msgid "新增套餐"
msgstr "Add Plan"

msgid "订阅管理"
msgstr "Subscription Management"

msgid "这里将用于查看租户订阅周期、续费情况和套餐生效状态，后续补充业务明细。"
msgstr "This page will show tenant subscription cycles, renewals, and plan activation status. Business details will be added later."

msgid "新增订阅"
msgstr "Add Subscription"

msgid "订单管理"
msgstr "Order Management"

msgid "这里将用于维护订单记录、支付状态和业务流水，当前先提供独立的管理页面。"
msgstr "This page will manage order records, payment status, and transaction flows. For now, it provides an independent management page."

msgid "新增订单"
msgstr "Add Order"

msgid "发票管理"
msgstr "Invoice Management"

msgid "这里将用于管理发票申请、开票状态和发票归档，详细流程后续再实现。"
msgstr "This page will manage invoice requests, issuance status, and invoice archiving. The detailed process will be implemented later."

msgid "新增发票"
msgstr "Add Invoice"

