msgstr "System Settings"

msgid "所选语言暂不支持，已恢复为默认语言。"
msgstr "The selected language is not supported and has been reset to the default language."

msgid "所选主题无效，已恢复为默认主题。"
msgstr "The selected theme is invalid and has been reset to the default theme."

msgid "系统设置已保存。"
msgstr "System settings have been saved."

