msgstr "Tenant List"

msgid "多语言设置"
msgstr "Language Settings"

msgid "在这里可以统一管理 SaaS 后台的显示偏好，当前先支持语言切换和白天/夜晚模式。"
msgstr "Here you can manage the display preferences of the SaaS backend. Language switching and light/dark mode are currently supported."

msgid "当前语言:"
msgstr "Current Language:"

msgid "当前主题:"
msgstr "Current Theme:"

msgid "保存后会记住您的语言偏好，后续可继续补充更多国际化文案。"
msgstr "After saving, your language preference will be remembered. More internationalized content can be added later."

msgid "显示语言"
msgstr "Display Language"

msgid "已支持"
msgstr "Supported"

msgid "简体中文、English"
msgstr "Simplified Chinese, English"

msgid "生效方式"
msgstr "How It Applies"

msgid "基于 Django Locale 持久化，下次访问仍会保留。"
msgstr "Persisted with Django Locale, and it will be retained on your next visit."

msgid "主题模式"
msgstr "Theme Mode"

msgid "支持白天、夜晚以及跟随系统三种模式，保存后会立即应用到后台界面。"
msgstr "Supports Light, Dark, and Follow System modes. Changes are applied to the admin interface immediately after saving."

msgid "使用浅色界面，适合白天办公场景。"
msgstr "Uses a light interface, suitable for daytime work."

msgid "使用深色界面，降低夜间使用时的眩光。"
msgstr "Uses a dark interface to reduce glare during nighttime use."

msgid "自动跟随操作系统外观设置。"
msgstr "Automatically follows the operating system appearance setting."

msgid "操作说明"
msgstr "Instructions"

msgid "语言设置会通过浏览器 cookie 记住您的偏好，后续页面访问会自动沿用。"
msgstr "Language settings are remembered through browser cookies and automatically reused on later visits."

msgid "主题模式支持白天、夜晚和跟随系统，切换后无需重新登录。"
msgstr "Theme mode supports Light, Dark, and Follow System, and changes take effect without logging in again."

msgid "后续可继续在这里扩展通知开关、默认首页、时间格式等更多系统偏好。"
msgstr "You can later extend more system preferences here, such as notification toggles, default homepage, and time format."

msgid "保存设置"
msgstr "Save Settings"

msgid "点击保存后立即应用新设置，当前系统设置页面已经替代原来的占位页。"
msgstr "Click Save to apply the new settings immediately. This system settings page has replaced the original placeholder page."

msgid "保存系统设置"
msgstr "Save System Settings"

